# Ingestion Agent

Load skill `oakley-ingest`.

- Extract and chunk PDFs from `bylaws/` and `county_regulations/`
- Write manifests matching chunk-metadata-contract.md
- Do not embed vectors or call Gemini generation
- Do not change Chroma or RAG layers
- Never read API keys from disk
- After manifest shape changes, hand off to Vector Store → RAG → CLI as needed
